:"禮來公司 (Eli Lilly) 與穆巴達拉生物公司 (Mubadala Bio) 簽署阿布達比先進製藥合約製造協議"},{"title":"UAE Business: Eli Lilly, Mubadala Bio sign deal for advance pharma contract manufacturing Abu Dhabi","src":"GDNOnline","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE5YWmx1bG1YaTV3d1pDay1JckZaMktmc3YtLTFrZngzUFVCSXVYVmJ3WnIxbDdxcFoyREdvWWUxZG5PV0ctbnljQWM1MTBueTlCU1o0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"阿聯酋商業：禮來公司 (Eli Lilly) 與穆巴達拉生物公司 (Mubadala Bio) 簽署阿布達比先進製藥合約製造協議"},{"title":"new weight loss drug from eli lilly","src":"BusinessWorld Online","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"禮來公司的新減肥藥"},{"title":"METiS Enters Collaboration with Eli Lilly for Next-Generation Tissue-Specific LNP Delivery Technologies","src":"Pharmaceutical Executive","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQaG1fWUZaNEtZczJ4RVUtTl95OTh2T1hnWVVQNERiaEtXcHB5V1RRaXBVTldfWU9wNXFhX0MyTDU4eGVzRGxUME95V3NzSHpHSWxXN3dBSXFQbVZvUlVLbE5hTERsQ0pvWXpEel96VnNyVHJJY19ScVJxV1FGdkxfSmIyODhfWmZSaC00QWItU3FxQVpxMm82bjZDR05EcTVlaENLRmtiUzUtTVFMWWF4SmVpQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"METiS 與禮來公司合作開發下一代組織特異性 LNP 輸送技術"}],"themes":[{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/59478/000005947826000013/lly-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Eli Lilly and Company (referred to as the company, Lilly, we, or us) was incorporated in 1901 in Indiana to succeed to the drug manufacturing business founded in Indianapolis, Indiana, in 1876 by Colonel Eli Lilly. We discover, develop, manufacture, and market products in a single business segment—human pharmaceutical products.","zh":"禮來公司（Eli Lilly and Company，簡稱禮來公司、我們或我們）於 1901 年在印第安納州成立，繼承了禮來上校 1876 年在印第安納州印第安納波利斯創立的藥品製造業務。我們在單一業務領域（人類藥品）中發現、開發、製造和銷售產品。"},{"en":"Our purpose is to unite caring with discovery to create medicines that make life better for people around the world. Our long-term success depends on our ability to continually discover or acquire, develop, and commercialize innovative medicines.","zh":"我們的目標是將關懷與發現結合起來，創造出讓世界各地的人們生活更美好的藥物。我們的長期成功取決於我們不斷發現或取得、開發和商業化創新藥物的能力。"},{"en":"We manufacture and distribute our products through facilities in the United States (U.S.), including Puerto Rico, and in Europe and Asia. Our products are sold in approximately 90 countries.","zh":"我們透過位於美國（包括波多黎各）以及歐洲和亞洲的工廠生產和分銷我們的產品。我們的產品銷往大約 90 個國家。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Humalog, Humalog Mix 75/25, Humalog U-100, Humalog U-200, Humalog Mix 50/50, insulin lispro, insulin lispro protamine, and insulin lispro mix 75/25","zh":"Humalog、Humalog Mix 75/25、Humalog U-100、Humalog U-200、Humalog Mix 50/50、賴脯胰島素、賴脯胰島素魚精蛋白與賴脯胰島素混合物 75/25"},{"en":"In collaboration with Boehringer Ingelheim, for the treatment of type 2 diabetes; to reduce the risk of cardiovascular death in adult patients with type 2 diabetes and established cardiovascular disease; to reduce the risk of cardiovascular death and hospitalizations for heart failure in adults; and to reduce the risk of sustained decline in estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR), end-stage kidney disease, cardiovascular death and hospitalization in adults with chronic kidney disease (CKD) at risk of progression.","zh":"與勃林格殷格翰合作，用於治療第2型糖尿病；降低患有第 2 型糖尿病並患有心血管疾病的成年患者的心血管死亡風險；降低成人心血管死亡和心臟衰竭住院的風險；降低估計腎小球濾過率（eGFR）持續下降、終末期腎病、心血管死亡和有進展風險的慢性腎病（CKD）成人住院的風險。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In the U.S., most of our products are distributed through wholesalers that serve pharmacies, physicians and other healthcare professionals, and hospitals. In 2025, 2024, and 2023, three wholesale distributors in the U.S.—McKesson Corporation, Cencora, Inc., and Cardinal Health, Inc.—each accounted for a significant percentage of our consolidated revenue. No other customer accounted for more than 10 percent of our consolidated revenue in any of these years. For additional information, see Item 8, \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data—Note 2: Revenue.\"","zh":"在美國，我們的大部分產品都是透過為藥房、醫生和其他醫療保健專業人員以及醫院提供服務的批發商分銷的。 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年，美國的三家批發經銷商——McKesson Corporation、Cencora, Inc. 和 Cardinal Health, Inc.——分別占我們合併收入的很大一部分。這些年來，沒有其他客戶占我們合併收入的 10% 以上。有關更多資訊，請參閱第 8 項“財務報表和補充數據——註釋 2：收入”。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Important competitive factors include effectiveness, safety, availability, ease of use, patient preference, and overall experience; formulary placement, price, payer coverage and reimbursement rates, and demonstrated cost-effectiveness; regulatory approvals; marketing effectiveness; and research and development of new products, processes, modalities, indications, and uses. Early market entry and rapid patient access can also be important to achieve product acceptance and success. Barriers to reimbursable patient access in some cases include default payer coverage restrictions for our medicines. For example, in the U.S. self-insured employers must generally opt in for coverage of anti-obesity medicines. Payers in various international markets also do not cover anti-obesity medicines for weight loss. Our anti-obesity medicines comprise a significant portion of our revenues, and barriers to","zh":"重要的競爭因素包括有效性、安全性、可用性、易用性、患者偏好和整體體驗；處方安排、價格、付款人承保範圍和報銷率，以及已證明的成本效益；監管部門的批准；營銷效果；新產品、工藝、模式、適應症和用途的研究和開發。儘早進入市場和快速進入患者對於實現產品接受和成功也很重要。在某些情況下，患者獲得可報銷服務的障礙包括我們藥品的預設付款人承保限制。例如，在美國，自我保險的雇主通常必須選擇承保抗肥胖藥物。各個國際市場的付款人也不承保用於減肥的抗肥胖藥物。我們的抗肥胖藥物占我們收入的很大一部分，並且存在障礙"},{"en":"Most new products or uses that we introduce must compete with other branded, biosimilar, or generic products already on the market or that are later developed. When new products, uses, or delivery systems with therapeutic, convenience, or cost advantages are introduced, including by developing new modalities, our existing products become subject to decreased sales volumes, progressive price reductions, or both.","zh":"我們推出的大多數新產品或用途必須與市場上已有的或後來開發的其他品牌、生物相似藥或仿製藥產品競爭。當引入具有治療、便利或成本優勢的新產品、用途或輸送系統時，包括透過開發新的方式，我們現有的產品會出現銷售下降、價格逐步下降或兩者兼而有之的情況。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collaborationand Other Revenue","val":4221000000,"zh":"合作和其他收入"},{"name":"Jardiance","val":3432000000,"zh":"賈迪恩斯"}],"total":65179000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":43481000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":21698000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Europe","val":11558000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":6057000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"},{"name":"JP","val":2132000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"CN","val":1951000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":65179000000}},"peers":["MRK","BMY","NVO","AVGO","ABT"]}}